            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Round 1: 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each (12 sts). Round 3: (dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (18 sts). Round 4: (2 dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (24 sts). Round 5: (3 dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (30 sts). Rounds 6-8: dc around. Round 9: (3 dc, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc2tog-a176"
