            "text": "dc2tog"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ") x 6 (24 sts). Round 10: (2 dc, dc2tog) x 6 (18 sts). Do not stuff yet. Leave open."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stem"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In cream yarn, magic ring 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each (12 sts). Round 3: (dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (18 sts). Rounds 4-10: dc around. Round 11: (dc, dc2tog) x 6 (12 sts). Stuff. Apply "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
